B.baC=s(["Kont platf\xf2m lan pa telechaje done p\xe8son\xe8l manm yo.","Le compte plateforme ne t\xe9l\xe9charge aucune donn\xe9e personnelle des membres.","The platform account does not download member personal data."],t.s)
