B.bkb=s(["Demann sa a gen l\xf2t done. Reprann ak menm enf\xf2masyon yo oswa rek\xf2manse apre verifikasyon.","Cette demande contient d\u2019autres donn\xe9es. Reprenez avec les m\xeames informations ou recommencez apr\xe8s v\xe9rification.","This request contains different details. Resume with the same information or restart after review."],t.s)
B.byM=s(["L\xe8 apar\xe8y la pa k\xf2r\xe8k pou operasyon sa a.","L\u2019horloge de l\u2019appareil est incorrecte pour cette op\xe9ration.","The device clock is incorrect for this operation."],t.s)
