B.bDq=s(["Pwopriyet\xe8 a ka kreye manadj\xe8 ak resepsyon s\xe8lman. S\xe8v\xe8 a verifye w\xf2l, sal la ak chak repriz demann.","Le propri\xe9taire peut cr\xe9er uniquement des responsables et r\xe9ceptionnistes. Le serveur v\xe9rifie le r\xf4le, la salle et chaque reprise.","The owner can create managers and reception staff only. The server verifies the role, gym and every retry."],t.s)
B.bHM=s(["Chanje aks\xe8 a","Modifier l\u2019acc\xe8s","Change access"],t.s)
B.byA=s(["Aplike nouvo w\xf2l/eta sa a? S\xe8v\xe8 a ap verifye v\xe8syon fiche a anvan chanjman an.","Appliquer ce nouveau r\xf4le/\xe9tat ? Le serveur v\xe9rifiera la version de la fiche avant le changement.","Apply this role/status? The server will check the record version before changing it."],t.s)
